    "summary": "Epic impact: covers Story s1 (sc1's dispatchState/export-dir model, which this Task's endTurn finalization mirrors exactly at the same transition points, and which the direct-spawn branch now threads through to the durable turn-end marker). A completed vibe turn's endTurn call carries its real dispatchState and vibeOutcome on the TurnExit object; a non-vibe (claude/codex) turn's endTurn call is unaffected, with both new fields staying undefined. Re-submitting this validate call only to carry forward the corrected test mapping after t7's follow-up split the shared detach/reattach test into clean-exit ('ok') and stopReason ('replay-unsafe') variants -- no further code change for t9 itself. All 119 cli-adapter.test.ts tests pass; both tsc --noEmit (root + vscode-plugin) are clean.",
